Oppai! No, no, no, not the oppai! Mococozan, Mococozan, Mococozan!

421
00:55:26,065 --> 00:55:30,065
Mococozan!

422
00:55:31,265 --> 00:55:36,825
Dakimakura... Super fluffy! Super huggy!

423
00:55:37,685 --> 00:55:40,145
Oppai!

424
00:55:40,145 --> 00:55:43,985
Oppai, you know, even though it might be a little bit embarrassing...

425
00:55:44,245 --> 00:55:47,525
We hope that we can help you sleep soundly at night, you know!

426
00:55:48,525 --> 00:55:54,385
Oppai! Mococozan, Mococozan!

427
00:55:55,425 --> 00:56:00,425
We have Fuwawa with You Plushie Keychain!

428
00:56:00,425 --> 00:56:04,425
Mococo with You Plushie Keychain! Compact size! Compact!

429
00:56:05,345 --> 00:56:13,845
