430
00:56:14,585 --> 00:56:20,585
Yeah! No matter what, we'll be by your side and super cute!

431
00:56:21,265 --> 00:56:26,545
But next, we have a very cool FUWAFUWA Hairband and MOCOMOCO Hairband!

432
00:56:26,885 --> 00:56:30,485
Maybe you're wondering, what exactly is this?

433
00:56:30,785 --> 00:56:36,865
Well, this way we can help keep back the fluff in the face when you wash your face at night, or maybe...

434
00:56:37,885 --> 00:56:44,485
You can just have fun with a quick Fuwawamocostyle disguise! It's up to you! Oh, up to you!

435
00:56:45,245 --> 00:56:51,825
Finally, we have some cute collectible button badges of Dakimakura Fuwamoco!

436
00:56:52,425 --> 00:57:01,265
But this quickly here, holographic! It come in a super cute heart shape! It's perfect for any ita-bags, you know! Just bringing a bit more Fuwamoco to your belongings!

437
00:57:02,325 --> 00:57:10,705
But, well, they also have something special as well, right Mococo? Even more special!

438
00:57:11,185 --> 00:57:17,965
Yeah! You know, what will help you get an even better rest at night, right?

439
00:57:19,005 --> 00:57:30,025
Well, maybe a soothing sleepover ASMR voice with Fuwawa is more your style? Or maybe there's a Fuwawa voice and a Mococo voice?

440
00:57:31,145 --> 00:57:38,445
But we hope that you'll listen to both of them right before bed!

441
00:57:39,025 --> 00:57:46,525
And finally, for those who purchase the entire set, we also have a special thank you bonus voice message as well!

442
00:57:47,045 --> 00:57:54,225
Yeah, and of course, there are also special hand-signed limited edition sets that come with a Polaroid-style card!

443
00:57:54,685 --> 00:58:03,725
Wow, so cute! We really hope that you'll be able to get your paws on them as well, Ruffians! We hope that we can help you have even sweeter dreams, just like this!

444
00:58:04,145 --> 00:58:15,725
And as a full set bonus, you'll receive one card that can be used in the hololive Official Card Game! One card for Fuwawa set, one card for Mococo set!

445
00:58:16,685 --> 00:58:27,685
And this card is only available to those who purchase from the hololive production official shop! Okay, got it? Please look forward to it, okay?

446
00:58:28,185 --> 00:58:34,225
Wow! Now, after that very exciting announcement...

447
00:58:34,225 --> 00:58:40,225
We still have one last song we'd like to sing for you today!

448
00:58:40,805 --> 00:58:50,225
